@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摇摇晃晃地<br>回到了审判庭。|#0105Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐——艾玛小姐——|#0105Adv09_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:远处传来呼唤艾玛的声音，<br>艾玛猛地抬起头。|#0105Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她蜷缩在审判庭的角落里，<br>似乎因疲惫而短暂失去了意识。|#0105Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露正走在过道上。<br>她还在寻找艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，你、你没事吗……？<br>有、有受伤吗……？|#0105Adv09_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露焦急地来回踱步，<br>声音中充满了关切。|#0105Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛尽量不发出脚步声，<br>小心翼翼地向出口靠近。|#0105Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:透过微开的门缝，<br>窥视着过道。|#0105Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露带着典狱长和看守。<br>还有——|#0105Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那是……可可？！）|#0105Adv09_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守扛着已经化为【残骸】的可可。<br>可可没有被冰冻，<br>正在挣扎扭动，发出呻吟声。|#0105Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:在森林里发现了变成【残骸】的可可小姐，<br>还找到了玛格小姐的尸体……|#0105Adv09_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在只剩下艾玛小姐了。|#0105Adv09_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你饿了吗？<br>有没有因为可可小姐袭击而受伤？<br>我真的、真的很担心你……|#0105Adv09_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0105Adv09_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不要被梅露露的声音迷惑！<br>　我现在已经没有同伴了！）|#0105Adv09_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然不得不把艾玛小姐也处理掉……<br>但其实，我真的不想这么做。|#0105Adv09_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当机关把管理这座监牢的任务交给我时，<br>他们要求我处理掉所有魔女因子含量高、<br>有可能成为魔女的危险分子……|#0105Adv09_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，那样实在太可怜了。<br>所以我，想要拯救大家……|#0105Adv09_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:还不如一开始就被杀死。|#0105Adv09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还不如一无所知地被处理掉。|#0105Adv09_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的善意和温柔<br>就像用丝绸勒住脖子，<br>越是温柔就越是成为折磨少女们的酷刑。|#0105Adv09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，我无论如何都想找到大魔女大人。<br>为此，必须要让大家变成魔女。|#0105Adv09_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:由于监牢内由我全权负责，<br>我就想出了【魔女审判】的系统。|#0105Adv09_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，无论审判了多少次都没有成功。<br>囚犯们只会变成【残骸】……|#0105Adv09_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛突然发现梅露露手里拿着一瓶透明液体。<br>——那是杀死魔女的药，【特雷德基姆】。|#0105Adv09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:只要有了我的【魔女杀手】魔法，<br>即使魔女变成了【残骸】，我也可以杀死。<br>但那样不就太可怜了吗……？|#0105Adv09_Meruru012| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我才把大家<br>冰冻并保存起来……|#0105Adv09_Meruru013| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然这么说着，<br>梅露露还是慢慢打开了那瓶药的盖子。|#0105Adv09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，让看守强行掰开挣扎的可可的嘴，<br>滴答滴答地往里倒入液体。|#0105Adv09_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊！！|#0105Adv09_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊讶得不由自主地叫出声来，<br>立刻捂住了自己的嘴。|#0105Adv09_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为时已晚。<br>梅露露的表情瞬间充满光彩，变得无比欣喜。|#0105Adv09_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

