[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，原来你在这里啊，艾玛小姐！<br>我一直在找你……|#0105Adv09_Meruru014| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别过来！！|#0105Adv09_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毫无抵抗之力的艾玛，<br>面对走进审判庭的梅露露，<br>只能大声喊叫。|#0105Adv09_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐讨厌我吗……？|#0105Adv09_Meruru015| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露注视艾玛的眼神充满悲伤。|#0105Adv09_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:我一直都是孤身一人……<br>很寂寞……请不要抛弃我……|#0105Adv09_Meruru016| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0105Adv09_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人对视了一会。<br>沉默充满了整个审判庭。|#0105Adv09_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:至今为止积累的回忆和牵绊，<br>不可抑制地动摇着艾玛的内心。|#0105Adv09_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后艾玛——|#0105Adv09_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:向梅露露走近|#0105Adv09_Choice001| Lock:false ButtonPath:ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
