# Choice1-5-2

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:15

[PrintTextModified Text:在最后关头，退后了一步。|#0105Adv09_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样内心纠结着，可能过了几十秒，也可能过了几分钟。|#0105Adv09_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛在视野边缘看到，可可重重地倒下了。<br>然后一动不动。她被杀死了。|#0105Adv09_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一幕让艾玛内心的纠结消失殆尽，恢复了理智。|#0105Adv09_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:（……不行，不能被迷惑……！）|#0105Adv09_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么要杀死可可？！|#0105Adv09_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，你完全是胡搅蛮缠！<br>口口声声说什么想救人啊想保护大家啊很担心什么的。|#0105Adv09_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一旦对自己不利，最后还是会杀人！|#0105Adv09_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嘴上说什么太可怜了，<br>却只是在慢慢折磨人……<br>那根本不是什么善意！|#0105Adv09_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……也许你说得对……|#0105Adv09_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露悲伤地垂下眼睛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，我很喜欢大家……<br>大家愿意把我当朋友，和我友好相处，<br>这让我很开心……|#0105Adv09_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守朝艾玛靠近。<br>如果那把镰刀挥下来，就完蛋了。|#0105Adv09_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此，艾玛还是忍不住说道。|#0105Adv09_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:谁跟你是朋友！|#0105Adv09_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，你根本不是我的朋友！|#0105Adv09_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的脸扭曲了起来，仿佛内心受到了深深的伤害。|#0105Adv09_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会……连艾玛小姐也……太过分了。<br>果然我还是孤身一人啊……|#0105Adv09_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只有大魔女大人<br>能理解我……|#0105Adv09_Meruru020| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好想见到大魔女大人啊……|#0105Adv09_Meruru021| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:大魔女……你说什么大魔女混在人类中间，<br>这只是你的臆想吧……？|#0105Adv09_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛此前也多次搜索和调查过监牢，<br>获得了不少关于大魔女的信息。|#0105Adv09_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管如此，大魔女的存在<br>对艾玛来说仍然缺乏真实感。|#0105Adv09_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大魔女什么的，真的存在吗……？<br>其实很久以前就不在了吧！？|#0105Adv09_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明一直都在艾玛身边。<br>明明一起来到了这里。|#0105Adv09_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为承认这一点，对艾玛来说——<br>是触碰禁忌的行为。|#0105Adv09_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:存在的！因为大魔女大人自己在消失前说过！<br>说要潜伏在人类社会中！|#0105Adv09_Meruru022| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的语气突然变得强烈，<br>让人深切感受到对她而言，<br>大魔女的存在绝不容质疑。|#0105Adv09_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:存在的！绝对存在的！<br>存在的！存在的！存在的！|#0105Adv09_Meruru023| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露……|#0105Adv09_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对、对了。请看这个。|#0105Adv09_Meruru024| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛突然想起什么，<br>梅露露从怀中取出一张照片。|#0105Adv09_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露刚才的激昂消失得无影无踪，<br>表情一转温和，脸颊泛起害羞似的微红。|#0105Adv09_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:这是之前被关在这里的一个囚犯给我的。<br>她拥有念写魔法。|#0105Adv09_Meruru025| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要触碰到我，就能把过去的回忆<br>变成照片。|#0105Adv09_Meruru026| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:我真的，真的很高兴。<br>她把我和大魔女大人的回忆变成了照片……|#0105Adv09_Meruru027| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然，她已经死了……<br>我真希望她能，多念写一些照片啊……|#0105Adv09_Meruru028| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露把那张照片<br>展示给艾玛看。|#0105Adv09_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

