[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露絮絮叨叨地说着，<br>但艾玛几乎没有在听。|#0105Adv09_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根本听不见梅露露的话。|#0105Adv09_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛只能一直凝视着眼前的照片。|#0105Adv09_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这、到底是、什么……？）|#0105Adv09_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:目击这难以置信的一幕，<br>思维完全停止运转。|#0105Adv09_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:颤抖的指尖<br>伸向照片。|#0105Adv09_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和梅露露一起出现在照片中的少女，<br>是艾玛认识的人。|#0105Adv09_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么可能会不认识呢。|#0105Adv09_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我是艾玛最好的朋友嘛。<br>|#0105Adv09_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（只是长得像……？<br>　不，不对……无论怎么看……）|#0105Adv09_Ema018|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——终于|#0105Adv09_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不对……这不对……？<br>我，认识这个人。|#0105Adv09_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——终于找到我了。|#0105Adv09_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我面前的艾玛，<br>瞪大眼睛，无力地坦白道。|#0105Adv09_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她……不是大魔女，是我的朋友。|#0105Adv09_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？你、你在说什么啊？<br>大魔女大人是我重要的人！<br>才不是艾玛小姐的朋友……！|#0105Adv09_Meruru039| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露脸颊气得红红的。|#0105Adv09_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:你不但要说我们不是朋友这么过分的话，<br>还要把大魔女大人从我身边夺走吗……|#0105Adv09_Meruru040| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就为了让我痛苦，连这种谎都说得出口。|#0105Adv09_Meruru041| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用力地摇了摇头。|#0105Adv09_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我没有撒谎。<br>她真的是我的朋友。|#0105Adv09_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛上初中的时候，和我形影不离。<br>|#0105Adv09_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在我也一直待在艾玛身边。|#0105Adv09_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:我想起来了……为什么会忘记呢。|#0105Adv09_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我做了很过分的事……<br>在初中的时候，我抛弃了她——|#0105Adv09_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚要说出口，<br>立刻用双手捂住嘴。|#0105Adv09_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_3 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

; ＠備考◆不規則な呼吸

[PrintTextModified Text:哈……哈……！！|#0105Adv09_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:强忍住尖叫。<br>耳边传来心脏剧烈跳动的声音。|#0105Adv09_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真可怜呀。|#0105Adv09_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:……什么……！？是谁？|#0105Adv09_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是谁在那里！？|#0105Adv09_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你不必为抛弃我<br>而感到内疚。|#0105Adv09_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我一直都在你身边。|#0105Adv09_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直。|#0105Adv09_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直。一直。|#0105Adv09_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直。一直。一直。|#0105Adv09_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直。一直。一直。一直。一直。<br>一直。一直。一直。一直。一直。<br>一直。一直。一直。一直。一直。|#0105Adv09_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我就在这里。|#0105Adv09_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我在这里注视着你。|#0105Adv09_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我在这里享受着你的痛苦。|#0105Adv09_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:怎、怎么了？<br>艾玛小姐，你在和谁说话！？|#0105Adv09_Meruru042| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，啊啊啊………啊啊……！|#0105Adv09_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆悲鳴を飲み込む

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0105Adv09_Ema028| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:善良的艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:乖孩子艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:纯洁的艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要你不想起来，记忆就不会被玷污了呢。<br>真可怜呀。真可怜呀。真可怜呀。|#0105Adv09_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，这一切终究还是你咎由自取。|#0105Adv09_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:是我……！|#0105Adv09_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是你，杀了我。|#0105Adv09_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; ========================================
; ここから演出で、[still illust14‐3]を何度かノイズ映像のように挟み
; たいです。ザザザといったSEつきで。
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3 SubId:Middle

; ザザザというノイズ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_74 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"艾<br>   玛|#0105Adv09_Yuki001|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——你做得很好。<br>选择你果然没错。|#0105Adv09_Yuki002| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3 SubId:Middle

; ザザザというノイズ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_74 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我一直在你耳边低语。<br>你终于想起我了。|#0105Adv09_Yuki003| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你给自己的心上了锁。|#0105Adv09_Yuki004| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3 SubId:Middle

; ザザザというノイズ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_74 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:因为如果不忘记我，<br>你的心就会崩溃。|#0105Adv09_Yuki005| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你一直臆想着自己很可怜呢。|#0105Adv09_Yuki006| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3 SubId:Middle

; ザザザというノイズ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_74 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:你，对正在被周围人伤害至崩溃<br>的我|#0105Adv09_Yuki007| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:视而不见。|#0105Adv09_Yuki008| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:漠不关心。|#0105Adv09_Yuki009| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3 SubId:Middle

; ザザザというノイズ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_74 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:若无其事。|#0105Adv09_Yuki010| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:善良的你<br>当然不可能做出<br>那么过分的事。|#0105Adv09_Yuki011| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:140_3 SubId:Middle

; ザザザというノイズ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_74 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:对善良的艾玛来说，<br>那是绝对不能踏足的，<br>不愿承认的，你内心的黑暗。|#0105Adv09_Yuki012| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希望你快点想起来，<br>快点被黑暗侵染吧。|#0105Adv09_Yuki013| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

