; 少女たちのくすくす笑う声
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_29_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——这里是囚牢。|#0105Adv09_Ema030| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:“我们要一直做好朋友。”<br>和我互相起誓的少女，<br>正在遭受霸凌。|#0105Adv09_Ema031| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她总是被人讨厌。|#0105Adv09_Ema032| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么呢。<br>在她身边，<br>总是接连发生不幸的事。|#0105Adv09_Ema033| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:涌出了从没见过的虫子。<br>传来臭水沟般的气味。<br>连花朵都会枯萎。|#0105Adv09_Ema034| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些理由，足以让她被人厌恶了。|#0105Adv09_Ema035| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时被锁在厕所隔间里。<br>有时课本被撕毁丢弃。<br>有时室内鞋里被塞满了图钉。|#0105Adv09_Ema036| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时被集体暴打施以私刑。<br>有时被绑起来当众羞辱。|#0105Adv09_Ema037| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有时。<br>有时。<br>有时——|#0105Adv09_Ema038| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有人会在我耳边说朋友的坏话。<br>窃窃私语，咯咯嗤笑，尽是嘲弄与恶意。|#0105Adv09_Ema039| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只想捂紧耳朵，抵挡身边涌现的恶意。|#0105Adv09_Ema040| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，我被无形的锁链束缚着，<br>就像个囚犯一样，连捂紧耳朵也做不到。|#0105Adv09_Ema041| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只能附和大家，假装笑着。|#0105Adv09_Ema042| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为，我不想被讨厌。<br>仅仅是这么简单的理由。|#0105Adv09_Ema043| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对朋友的霸凌日益变本加厉，<br>我的心脏也好似灌铅般愈发沉重。|#0105Adv09_Ema044| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住手吧。<br>住手。住手。住手住手住手。|#0105Adv09_Ema045| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要再欺负她了！！|#0105Adv09_Ema046| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唯有这句话不管怎样都说不出口。|#0105Adv09_Ema047| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为一旦反驳，<br>下一个被霸凌的就是自己。|#0105Adv09_Ema048| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我害怕孤身一人。<br>仅仅是这么简单的理由。|#0105Adv09_Ema049| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是假装事不关己，成为了【旁观者】。|#0105Adv09_Ema050| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她被辱骂，被欺侮，被嘲笑，<br>每日如此，不见尽头。<br>如此残酷的行为，竟长期持续，未曾断绝。|#0105Adv09_Ema051| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不禁开始责备比任何人都胆小的自己。<br>我太过讨厌自己，<br>甚至想要就此消失。|#0105Adv09_Ema052| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对一成不变的日常感到绝望的我，<br>堕入了无边的黑暗之中。|#0105Adv09_Ema053| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:朋友那双失去焦点、布满绝望的眼睛，<br>正望向我。|#0105Adv09_Ema054| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她忽然微笑，开口。<br>唤出了我的名字。|#0105Adv09_Ema055| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

