@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:"艾   玛|#0105Adv09_Yuki014|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使如此<br>艾玛还是<br>特别的哦|#0105Adv09_Yuki015| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"因为你的笑容<br>很 美丽|#0105Adv09_Yuki016|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"我是<br>  被唾弃<br>    受厌恶的存在|#0105Adv09_Yuki017|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而你，却是<br>少数几个愿意和我<br>做朋友的人|#0105Adv09_Yuki018| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"明明我　又脏<br>又臭　还会让人生病|#0105Adv09_Yuki019|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"你那勉强挤出的笑容<br>还有你那虚伪的善良　我最喜欢了|#0105Adv09_Yuki020|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我选择作为人类死去<br>只是因为想附在你身上|#0105Adv09_Yuki021| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:给<br>最喜欢的艾玛|#0105Adv09_Yuki022| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"我要把特别的魔法  送给你哦|#0105Adv09_Yuki023|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"成为魔女吧<br>然后把大家<br>        统统杀掉吧|#0105Adv09_Yuki024|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"纯洁的艾玛 善良的艾玛 乖孩子艾玛|#0105Adv09_Yuki025|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是一场游戏|#0105Adv09_Yuki026| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"让我看看你到底能够<br>  堕落得多么肮脏呢|#0105Adv09_Yuki027|" AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:啊、啊啊、啊……啊。|#0105Adv09_Ema056| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我、我的、是我——是我是我是我！）|#0105Adv09_Ema057| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（——是我抛弃了朋友，杀死了她）|#0105Adv09_Ema058| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:够、够了……<br>不管你试图用什么手段迷惑我，都没用的。|#0105Adv09_Meruru043| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，永别了。|#0105Adv09_Meruru044| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:听到那冰冷的声音，<br>艾玛猛地抬起头。|#0105Adv09_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知何时，看守已经逼近艾玛面前，<br>举起了镰刀。|#0105Adv09_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0105Adv09_Ema059| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一刹那。|#0105Adv09_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

