[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛全身突然放射出耀眼的光芒。|#0105Adv09_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:光芒笼罩了整个空间，<br>甚至颤动了周围的空气。|#0105Adv09_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过于刺眼的光芒使看守停下了动作。<br>梅露露眯起了眼睛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

