; ========================================
; 演出相談：骨の翼だけクローズアップ
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露稍微睁开眼，看到的是<br>——翅膀。|#0105Adv09_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出相談：徐々に全貌を見せてほしいです。
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0105Adv09_Ema060| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的外表几乎和先前一样。<br>不同之处只是眼神变得空洞，<br>背后生出了巨大的羽翼。|#0105Adv09_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你这副样子，怎么回事？|#0105Adv09_Meruru046| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毫无疑问，<br>这是艾玛觉醒为魔女的形态。|#0105Adv09_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但对梅露露来说，这是未知的景象。|#0105Adv09_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拥有魔女因子的少女，<br>理应会变成更丑陋的怪物才对。|#0105Adv09_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——而艾玛却仍然保持着人形。|#0105Adv09_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:简直，就和梅露露自己一样。|#0105Adv09_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、小姐……？<br>请回答我吧。这种情况，我从未听说过。|#0105Adv09_Meruru047| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的声音中带着些许恐惧。|#0105Adv09_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为艾玛的表情中<br>已经完全看不出先前的人格。|#0105Adv09_Narrative089| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被大魔女授予了特殊魔法的人，艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative090| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于迎来了施展这魔法的时刻。|#0105Adv09_Narrative091| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛仿佛从天际降临一般展开双翼，<br>轻盈地落于地面。|#0105Adv09_Narrative092| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那个……|#0105Adv09_Meruru048| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:3 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,-10 AppearanceAndTransition:20_1

[PrintTextModified Text:去死吧。|#0105Adv09_Ema061| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛打断了梅露露的话，开口说道。|#0105Adv09_Narrative093| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她望向梅露露身旁——<br>只吐出这短短一句。|#0105Adv09_Narrative094| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守顿时停止了动作，<br>无力地倒在地上。|#0105Adv09_Narrative095| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:连一声惨叫都未发出，再也没有了动静。<br>生命，彻底终止了。|#0105Adv09_Narrative096| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0105Adv09_Meruru049| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露茫然呆立在原地。|#0105Adv09_Narrative097| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这怎么可能，为什么，为什么……<br>看守小姐……<br>不、不可以，不要啊……|#0105Adv09_Meruru050| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守死去的事实，<br>令梅露露面容扭曲地哭了起来。|#0105Adv09_Narrative098| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:太、太过分了，怎么能这样……<br>这是你下的手吗，艾玛小姐……|#0105Adv09_Meruru051| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么……我已经不明白了……<br>居然杀死了魔女，<br>到底是怎么做到的……这简直就像是……|#0105Adv09_Meruru052| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女杀手。|#0105Adv09_Ema062| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一句话，<br>让梅露露的表情瞬间凝固。|#0105Adv09_Narrative099| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我好像就是得到了这样的魔法。|#0105Adv09_Ema063| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:头脑非常清晰。<br>感觉真奇妙。|#0105Adv09_Ema064| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是……一种从未体验过的情绪<br>正在我心中膨胀，无法平息。|#0105Adv09_Ema065| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是愤怒，是憎恨，还有……<br>这种心情……该怎么形容呢。|#0105Adv09_Ema066| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想杀人。|#0105Adv09_Narrative100| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:3 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,-10 AppearanceAndTransition:20_2 SubId:Middle
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:没错，我【想杀人】。|#0105Adv09_Ema067| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——一切都是眼前这个家伙的错。<br>艾玛无法抑制对眼前这名少女的杀意。|#0105Adv09_Narrative101| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我……和大魔女曾经是朋友。|#0105Adv09_Ema068| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不可能。<br>大魔女大人不可能和人类成为朋友。|#0105Adv09_Meruru053| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她授予了我，只授予了我一人<br>某种特殊的魔法。|#0105Adv09_Ema069| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:世界上的所有人，<br>都是拥有魔女因子的魔女。|#0105Adv09_Ema070| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我听到了一个声音，让我<br>把魔女……大量屠杀。|#0105Adv09_Ema071| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:骗人的！魔女杀手是<br>大魔女大人赐予的，属于我的宝贵力量……|#0105Adv09_Meruru054| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是假的。<br>……只是你的信仰心造就的妄想罢了。|#0105Adv09_Ema072| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛冷冷地俯视着梅露露，<br>目光中毫无感情。|#0105Adv09_Narrative102| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真可惜。|#0105Adv09_Ema073| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0105Adv09_Meruru055| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的表情第一次因绝望而扭曲。|#0105Adv09_Narrative103| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她已无力反抗。<br>只要艾玛一句话，梅露露就会当场死亡。|#0105Adv09_Narrative104| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长，准备处刑台。|#0105Adv09_Ema074| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛头也不回地<br>对候在房间角落的典狱长说道。|#0105Adv09_Narrative105| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！？啊、啊啊，好的。<br>梅露露大人，请不要怪罪。|#0105Adv09_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长立即执行了指示，<br>审判庭的中央随即打开。|#0105Adv09_Narrative106| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那地面之下，就像地狱之门开启般，<br>滚烫的红色液体正不断沸腾翻滚，<br>发出粘稠的咕嘟声。|#0105Adv09_Narrative107| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经准备好了。<br>那么我就——|#0105Adv09_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:去死吧。|#0105Adv09_Ema075| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛朝梅露露走去。<br>与此同时，典狱长落在地上，<br>不再动弹。|#0105Adv09_Narrative108| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，梅露露。魔女可是必须被处决的。|#0105Adv09_Ema076| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看，那里正好有个处刑台。<br>你也可以和大家一样去死了。|#0105Adv09_Ema077| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……|#0105Adv09_Meruru056| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛抓住梅露露的手腕，<br>拖着她走向处刑台。|#0105Adv09_Narrative109| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

