[PrintTextModified Text:处刑台上准备好的是<br>一个巨大的火窑。|#0105Adv09_Narrative110| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:窑中赤红的火焰如起舞般升腾，<br>热浪包裹着梅露露和艾玛的肌肤。|#0105Adv09_Narrative111| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露眼中映出火焰，染红了她的瞳孔。|#0105Adv09_Narrative112| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:火窑中吹出强烈的热风，<br>吹拂起她的头发。|#0105Adv09_Narrative113| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾、艾玛小姐……<br>我，那个，对不起……|#0105Adv09_Meruru057| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在火窑前艾玛放开了梅露露的手。<br>梅露露马上一点一点地退离艾玛身边。|#0105Adv09_Narrative114| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:身后是沸腾的火窑。|#0105Adv09_Narrative115| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们一起在这里生活下去好吗……？<br>我觉得，<br>我们一定能好好相处的……|#0105Adv09_Meruru058| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然有过误会……<br>但我相信我们能成为真正的朋友……|#0105Adv09_Meruru059| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:同为被大魔女大人选中的人……|#0105Adv09_Meruru060| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛毫不留情地摇了摇头。|#0105Adv09_Narrative116| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不可能的。梅露露，<br>你没有被选中。|#0105Adv09_Ema078| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不会的。<br>因为我一直都这么<br>思念着大魔女大人——|#0105Adv09_Meruru061| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:白费力气了呢。|#0105Adv09_Ema079| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一句话，<br>让梅露露的表情剧烈扭曲了起来。|#0105Adv09_Narrative117| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你已经被抛弃了。|#0105Adv09_Ema080| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要……|#0105Adv09_Meruru062| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你被大魔女抛弃，而我则被大魔女选中。|#0105Adv09_Ema081| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不要，不要，不要啊啊啊啊！！|#0105Adv09_Meruru063| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对梅露露来说，这是她最不想听到的话。<br>所以艾玛才特意说出口。|#0105Adv09_Narrative118| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆嘲笑気味に

[PrintTextModified Text:真可怜呀。|#0105Adv09_Ema082| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露捂住耳朵，发出尖叫。|#0105Adv09_Narrative119| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

