@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛轻轻地推了一下她的胸口。|#0105Adv09_Narrative120| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:去死吧。|#0105Adv09_Ema083| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:430_3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:伴随着凄厉的惨叫，火焰高高窜起，<br>在高温的炙烤下，梅露露逐渐融化。|#0105Adv09_Narrative121| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:肉块烧焦的声音劈啪作响，焦臭味在空气中弥漫。|#0105Adv09_Narrative122| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛凝视着熊熊燃烧的火焰，一言不发。|#0105Adv09_Narrative123| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

