[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative124| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛。|#0105Adv09_Narrative125| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事……？|#0105Adv09_Ema084| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你做得很好。|#0105Adv09_Narrative126| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

